.claude/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
node_modules/
*.log
services/bot/status.json
# Secret stores that live in the Pi's home directory. They should never be
# inside the repo at all; these lines are the belt in case one gets copied
# here by accident.
.gwcfc_webhooks.json
.gwcfc_ambient.json
.gwcfc_fb_auth.json

# The Discord bot records which avatar it last uploaded, so a restart does not
# spend one of Discord's tight avatar-change allowance re-sending the same
# picture. Local state, not source.
services/bot/.avatar-stamp

# A standalone harness for testing the nowcast pipeline on a dev machine
# without NOAA access or the real Pi/LXC: synthetic radar frames, a Docker
# build of the venv (pysteps needs a C compiler the real host has and a
# Windows dev box usually does not), and a viewer page. Never meant to ship;
# everything under it, including whatever test data and containers it
# produces, is throwaway.
local-test/
